{"unit_id":"Eureka-KK__dsh-rightclick-paste#card-zh","repo":"Eureka-KK/dsh-rightclick-paste","commit":"020d6434484a28ecb00e3dff730468e5134b5140","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rightclick-paste（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在输入框区域右键，把剪贴板中的纯文本追加到当前会话草稿。它通过浏览器端 contextmenu 事件识别输入区，读取剪贴板后复用 DSH 的草稿接口写入，并抑制该区域的原生右键菜单。主要功能包括追加时按需换行、输入卡片空白区域命中、Shift+右键保留原生菜单，以及剪贴板异常和超长文本处理。适合希望用鼠标快速把复制文本放入 DSH 草稿的用户。需要浏览器提供剪贴板文本读取能力，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:55-68","lib/client.js:76-89","lib/client.js:132-147","lib/client.js:181-204"]}
{"unit_id":"Eureka-KK__dsh-rightclick-paste#card-en","repo":"Eureka-KK/dsh-rightclick-paste","commit":"020d6434484a28ecb00e3dff730468e5134b5140","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rightclick-paste adds plain clipboard text to the current DSH draft when you right-click the composer. It uses the draft API, adds a newline when needed, and preserves the native menu with Shift+right-click. Clipboard access is required; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:55-68","lib/client.js:76-89","lib/client.js:132-147","lib/client.js:181-204"]}
