{"unit_id":"Eureka-KK__dsh-rightclick-paste#feature-1","repo":"Eureka-KK/dsh-rightclick-paste","commit":"020d6434484a28ecb00e3dff730468e5134b5140","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"输入区右键粘贴：在 DSH 输入区或输入卡片空白处右键，插件读取剪贴板纯文本并追加到当前会话草稿；已有草稿且未以换行结束时会先补换行。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:55-68","lib/client.js:132-147","lib/client.js:181-190"]}
